{
  "label": "V3 Dome Model",
  "tags": [
    "dome",
    "mesh",
    "V3"
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "description": "UI mesh of the V3 dome scaffold; v3_dome_model.obj comes from Generators/generate_v3_dome_model.py (3V 5/9 Kruschke, 23 ft diameter, feet, Y-up, base ring on y=0, oriented via the model instance transform). The second mesh draws each cell's number in its own face, placed by dome_faces() and triangle_transform() from Generators/generate_v3_dome_playa_edition.py -- ring by ring from the apex, clockwise from twelve o'clock seen from above. The numbers carry the module's baked yaw, so each one sits centred on the LED triangle it names; place this mesh at the same yaw as the LED fixture."
  },
